Z||000000||Monkeyman||02-21-2001||06:55 PM||||I'm trying to install PIP on my new computer and can't quite remember what to do.  I've got it to the point where it's asking for a profile.  What's the profile name and is there any other info I'll need?  I'd like to start posting some pics again.<P>Thanx--<P>MM||||reg||5
