Z||000002||FieroJoe||02-21-2001||10:11 PM||||The directory 2xsess is talking about is where the pip program will place your pictures.  There is a special "PIP Profile" file that is somewhere here on the forum server.  When you get pip installed, click on "Profiles" at the top, and select "New Profile".  Make sure you select the "Auto Config" bullet, and then paste in this link: <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/fieroforum.pip" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/fieroforum.pip</A>  into the box.  Then click the "Get it" button.  you should be all set from there!<P>------------------<BR>FieroJoe<BR>c311t@yahoo.com<BR>AIM: Fiero87311, Snowboarder0311<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/profile_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
